rain snow hail all things we used to  sing fall from the sky on any given day  we don't think twice when it starts to  rain but over the course of history  there have been some truly weird things  to fall on their unsuspecting victims  take for example the strange account of  the town of Lodge Amon in Australia in  2004 the locals of this remote town  reported hundreds and hundreds of small  white fish falling from the sky still  alive as if a freak fish storm isn't  weird enough Lodge Amon who sits on the  edge of the Tanami desert hundreds of  kilometers from Lake Argyle and Lake  Elliott the closest bodies of water most  meteorologists speculate that the  incident was probably caused by a  tornado that would have plucked the fish  from the water launched them into the  weather system where they would have  been essentially frozen and eventually  deposited as fishy hailstones over the  tiny Outback town 2004 wasn't the first  or last time perch fell from the sky and  Lajamanu either in 1980 and twice in  2010 locals were greeted by a light  dusting of seafood on the subject of  food let's travel back in time to March  3rd 1876 it was a clear spring day in  Olympia Springs Kentucky and a certain  mrs. Crouch was making soap outside her  house when she noticed that it had  started to snow not actual snow mind you  but large flakes of what looked like  beef the following day an inspector came  to verify the story and sure enough he  noted the presence of meat flakes  covering the area he said that most of  the flakes were roughly 5 centimetres  square though at least some were twice  that size two unidentified men turned up  and apparently with complete disregard  for their health decided to taste the  meat they declared that it tasted like  either venison or mutton various  explanations were proposed over the  following months some scientists  claiming the flakes were bacteria others  claiming that it was lung tissue of  either human infant or horse until it  was finally confirmed that the  mysterious fleshy precipitation was  indeed meat of some sort in all seven  specimens were examined by scientists  two were confirmed to be lung tissue  three to be muscle tissue and two to be  cartilage but where did they come from  and why did they fall from the sky one  dr. LD Caston bine proposed the most  likely explanation for the phenomenon  were likely ever going to get the meat  he said was the product of a  synchronized barrage of projectile  vulture vomit the two species of vulture  found in Kentucky the black vulture in  the turkey vulture are Bo  known to projectile vomit their stomach  contents as a defense mechanism or to  make themselves light enough for  sustained flight regardless of where the  meat came from I personally would not  have tasted it moving back to more  recent events let's look at the creepy  crawly account of Christian Annette o  gown and his friends who are hiking in  Argentina over their Easter vacation on  April 6 2007 Christian and his friends  were hiking the San Bernardo Mountain  two hours into their Trek they came upon  an area where the ground was completely  blanketed in spiders each about four  inches across unlike your humble  narrator would have done the hikers  continued on their way finding more and  more spiders as they went at one point  they looked up and saw the nightmarish  sight of dozens of spiders falling from  the sky luckily or unluckily Christian  remembered he had a camera with him he  caught a picture of the tiny skydivers  in flight and a close-up of one  beginning to spin its web christian said  the event seemed like something out of a  science-fiction movie versus real life  while spiders can glide without a  parachute just fine larger creatures  tend to have more difficulty with the  whole landing safely thing London  September of 2012 residents of the  Mortlake neighborhood came across a  grisly scene outside a traditional  Chinese medicine shop the mangled body  of an unidentified man the police began  their investigation suspecting foul play  and deduced from the remains that the  victim was approximately five feet four  inches tall and between twenty and  thirty years old they also discovered  that he wasn't murdered at all unless  you can blame gravity his injuries were  sustained from a very long fall  specifically from a passenger jet  authorities suspect that this brilliant  individual decided to stow away on a  plane headed for Heathrow Airport then  probably realized his mistake when the  landing gear was deployed and he fell to  his untimely demise not to worry the  civil aviation authority states that he  probably died long before you at the  ground he was likely crushed when the  landing gear retracted after takeoff or  he may have frozen in the minus 40  degree Celsius compartment much better  than death by inertia right speaking of  the strange relationship between larger  creatures and gravity quite possibly the  strangest thing to fall from the sky was  a cow yep you heard that right  in 1997 some Japanese fishermen were  minding their own business when roughly  1,200 pounds of uncooked hamburger  streak from the sky like a meaty meteor  and left a cow a pole in their boat the  fishermen were eventually rescued after  clinging to the wreckage for several  hours and then promptly put in jail for  claiming their vessel  been sunk by a kamikaze cow the poor  confused fisherman remained in prison  for several weeks until Japanese  authorities got a highly unusual call  from Russian Air Force officials what  really happened was that the crew of a  Russian cargo plane had stolen a cow  that wandered too close to their  Siberian airfield and packed it away in  their plane for the flight home thinking  it would be a good supply of beef  unfortunately the cow started to panic  and caused chaos in the cargo hold  affecting the planes stability this made  the crew exactly nervous enough to  jettison the poor creature 30,000 feet  above the Sea of Japan it was a bad day  for everyone involved so the next time  you complain about a little snow or rain  just remember that some poor suckers in  Japan had a cow dropped on them and be  thankful if you enjoyed this video  please like and subscribe to keep up  with the latest content and be sure to  check out my channel for my other videos  thanks for watching and we'll see you in  the next video
 

